1
00:00:05,400 --> 00:00:06,401
[This drama is intended for entertainment purposes only.]

2
00:00:06,411 --> 00:00:08,400
[All characters, behaviors, locations, and events depicted are fictional.]

3
00:00:08,430 --> 00:00:09,950
[It is not intended to be sexually suggestive or to encourage viewers]

4
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:11,501
[to engage in inappropriate or morally objectionable behavior.]

5
00:00:11,511 --> 00:00:12,890
[Nor is it intended to discredit any profession]

6
00:00:12,899 --> 00:00:13,900
[or create negative perceptions of any organization]

7
00:00:13,911 --> 00:00:14,912
[or any particular group of people.]

8
00:00:14,920 --> 00:00:17,907
But based on the clues we have so far, our prime suspect

9
00:00:17,921 --> 00:00:19,022
is Jenphop.

10
00:00:19,166 --> 00:00:23,640
Today, Mrs. Nopnapha is about to slap that shameless bitch Mutta again!

11
00:00:23,651 --> 00:00:26,520
Today, someone who was once her victim is fighting back!

12
00:00:29,235 --> 00:00:30,520
Mutta, you bitch!

13
00:00:30,531 --> 00:00:32,120
You're going to die a horrible death!

14
00:00:32,254 --> 00:00:35,800
Our ministry is overstaffed. We need to unnecessary positions.

15
00:00:35,896 --> 00:00:38,207
They're not firing everyone, just two people.

16
00:00:38,220 --> 00:00:39,240
I'm one of the two

17
00:00:40,721 --> 00:00:41,722
who has to go, right?

18
00:00:42,075 --> 00:00:44,400
I'm sick of my family. Just looking for someone to talk to.

19
00:00:44,624 --> 00:00:45,925
I'm sick of mine too.

20
00:00:46,096 --> 00:00:49,097
Hey, have you ever stumbled upon any of your dad's secrets?

21
00:00:49,200 --> 00:00:52,201
If they have any secrets, they're probably hidden at work.

22
00:00:53,859 --> 00:00:55,000
Fire!

23
00:01:03,355 --> 00:01:04,646
Ta! Where is Ta?

24
00:01:04,742 --> 00:01:08,200
Oh, I saw her leave the office a while before the alarm went off.

25
00:01:34,896 --> 00:01:35,897
Ta?

26
00:01:36,011 --> 00:01:37,012
Veekit.

27
00:01:44,558 --> 00:01:45,559
What are you doing in here?

28
00:01:50,280 --> 00:01:52,281
[Hong]

29
00:01:57,747 --> 00:01:59,680
You've known about Director and Hong all along, haven't you?

30
00:02:01,550 --> 00:02:03,560
I've told you so many times to stay away from Uncle Phop.

31
00:02:03,912 --> 00:02:04,915
But you wouldn't listen.

32
00:02:04,920 --> 00:02:06,387
Then why didn't you ever tell me about Hong?

33
00:02:06,568 --> 00:02:08,000
What good would that have done, Ta?

34
00:02:08,400 --> 00:02:10,200
Would you have left Uncle Phop if I'd told you?

35
00:02:13,443 --> 00:02:14,800
How long have they been sleeping together?

36
00:02:16,472 --> 00:02:17,473
A long time.

37
00:02:20,230 --> 00:02:21,280
Even before you came along.

38
00:02:24,160 --> 00:02:25,240
Are they still seeing each other?

39
00:02:32,912 --> 00:02:34,640
What other secrets have you been keeping from me?

40
00:02:36,054 --> 00:02:37,055
Tell me everything.

41
00:02:41,579 --> 00:02:42,580
I'm the one

42
00:02:43,259 --> 00:02:44,760
who should be asking you that.

43
00:04:27,475 --> 00:04:28,520
Hello.

44
00:04:28,900 --> 00:04:29,701
Hello.

45
00:04:29,801 --> 00:04:30,802
Shall we get going?

46
00:04:31,320 --> 00:04:32,321
Sure.

47
00:04:44,700 --> 00:04:45,701
This way, please.

48
00:04:46,080 --> 00:04:47,440
Sorry about the mess.

49
00:04:47,640 --> 00:04:48,760
Thanks for having me.

50
00:04:53,862 --> 00:04:54,863
I brought you something.

51
00:04:55,110 --> 00:04:57,740
Wow! Thank you!

52
00:04:57,931 --> 00:05:01,640
It's huge. Is this a Jintara watermelon?

53
00:05:02,320 --> 00:05:04,440
No, it's a Kinnaree kind.

54
00:05:04,450 --> 00:05:05,680
Jintara watermelons are expensive.

55
00:05:15,707 --> 00:05:16,720
Take it off.

56
00:05:18,422 --> 00:05:21,080
Aren't you going to take off your mask too?

57
00:05:21,654 --> 00:05:24,400
I can't take it off. It's part of my uniform.

58
00:05:24,744 --> 00:05:27,045
Then how are you supposed to put it in your mouth?

59
00:05:29,363 --> 00:05:30,364
Don't worry.

60
00:05:32,419 --> 00:05:34,700
I've done this for hundreds of people.

61
00:06:07,326 --> 00:06:08,720
Thank you so much.

62
00:06:09,347 --> 00:06:10,960
I'll come see you again sometime.

63
00:06:12,259 --> 00:06:14,000
Thank you too.

64
00:06:15,260 --> 00:06:16,261
But next time,

65
00:06:17,384 --> 00:06:21,485
could you bring me jicama or snow lotus fruit instead?

66
00:06:21,710 --> 00:06:23,700
I'm getting tired of watermelon.

67
00:06:24,755 --> 00:06:25,756
Sure.

68
00:06:26,963 --> 00:06:28,040
Wait a moment.

69
00:06:36,056 --> 00:06:37,560
A little souvenir for you.

70
00:06:49,560 --> 00:06:50,760
Thank you so much.

71
00:06:51,059 --> 00:06:52,760
- See you again.
- Sure.

72
00:06:54,046 --> 00:06:55,047
Hong.

73
00:07:00,568 --> 00:07:01,920
Hong, wait!

74
00:07:03,288 --> 00:07:04,880
Where are you going? Can't you hear me calling?

75
00:07:06,851 --> 00:07:10,083
Oh, Ta!

76
00:07:10,691 --> 00:07:12,320
I didn't realize it was you.

77
00:07:12,936 --> 00:07:14,600
What brings you here?

78
00:07:30,510 --> 00:07:33,120
That was my brother just now.

79
00:07:33,219 --> 00:07:34,920
He doesn't visit very often.

80
00:07:35,982 --> 00:07:37,896
Let me cut up some watermelon for you.

81
00:07:40,283 --> 00:07:41,284
What kind of brother

82
00:07:41,986 --> 00:07:44,087
gets underwear as a souvenir?

83
00:07:47,614 --> 00:07:50,760
You saw that? You've got sharp eyes.

84
00:07:51,875 --> 00:07:56,280
Well, my brother stayed over last month and left them behind.

85
00:07:56,574 --> 00:07:58,238
I accidentally put them on.

86
00:07:58,320 --> 00:08:00,520
When I realized, I washed them and gave them back.

87
00:08:00,670 --> 00:08:03,170
Men are so messy, aren't they?

88
00:08:07,700 --> 00:08:10,483
Oh! Whose is that?

89
00:08:10,574 --> 00:08:12,575
Why does it have my name on it?

90
00:08:13,035 --> 00:08:14,360
Drop the act already.

91
00:08:15,606 --> 00:08:17,520
I know everything about you and the Director.

92
00:08:30,267 --> 00:08:33,040
Ta, please don't bring this up again.

93
00:08:34,300 --> 00:08:35,301
I'm...

94
00:08:35,664 --> 00:08:37,480
I'm deeply hurt.

95
00:08:39,030 --> 00:08:40,320
The Director...

96
00:08:41,712 --> 00:08:43,880
He forced himself on me.

97
00:08:44,800 --> 00:08:47,560
He took my virginity.

98
00:09:01,995 --> 00:09:03,040
I found it on a website.

99
00:09:03,536 --> 00:09:04,537
Onlyfun.

100
00:09:07,062 --> 00:09:08,400
How did you find it?

101
00:09:08,763 --> 00:09:09,800
I subscribed, of course.

102
00:09:10,726 --> 00:09:12,300
Standard or Gold?

103
00:09:12,688 --> 00:09:15,189
Premium. I get to watch everything three days early.

104
00:09:16,683 --> 00:09:20,040
Oh... What were they doing in the video?

105
00:09:20,064 --> 00:09:22,080
I've never seen it before.

106
00:09:24,451 --> 00:09:26,960
Judging by the camera angle, I'd say...

107
00:09:28,579 --> 00:09:30,520
Ta... Ta, please!

108
00:09:30,580 --> 00:09:31,581
Ta!

109
00:09:32,110 --> 00:09:33,111
Ta!

110
00:09:41,878 --> 00:09:42,879
Ta!

111
00:09:43,640 --> 00:09:44,641
Ta!

112
00:09:46,032 --> 00:09:47,320
What are you doing?

113
00:09:48,656 --> 00:09:49,657
Ta!

114
00:09:59,400 --> 00:10:00,401
Oh!

115
00:10:01,032 --> 00:10:04,086
When did someone hide a camera inside this duck?

116
00:10:14,904 --> 00:10:16,400
I talked to some people in your building.

117
00:10:17,726 --> 00:10:19,720
They said you invite

118
00:10:20,296 --> 00:10:22,240
dozens of different men to your room every month.

119
00:10:23,256 --> 00:10:24,920
Each one has to bring you a gift.

120
00:10:26,011 --> 00:10:28,080
And you give them underwear in return.

121
00:10:30,536 --> 00:10:33,600
I don't care what you do on the side.

122
00:10:34,630 --> 00:10:36,760
I just want you to know that I've figured out

123
00:10:37,014 --> 00:10:39,515
you're not the sweet, innocent little bird you pretend to be.

124
00:10:40,134 --> 00:10:42,600
So please,

125
00:10:43,640 --> 00:10:45,560
drop the act for just ten minutes

126
00:10:46,441 --> 00:10:47,880
so we can have a proper conversation.

127
00:10:56,451 --> 00:10:58,600
But I've never

128
00:10:59,848 --> 00:11:03,120
pretended to be someone I'm not, Ta.

129
00:11:07,240 --> 00:11:09,241
What do you want to talk about?

130
00:11:09,976 --> 00:11:11,843
I'll be completely honest with you.

131
00:11:11,900 --> 00:11:12,920
The Director.

132
00:11:14,072 --> 00:11:16,672
But I think we both know

133
00:11:16,880 --> 00:11:19,560
everything there is to know about him.

134
00:11:21,136 --> 00:11:24,118
His size, his moves...

135
00:11:25,558 --> 00:11:28,334
You might even know him better than I do.

136
00:11:29,054 --> 00:11:32,254
I want to know what happened when I was away.

137
00:11:33,400 --> 00:11:34,760
When he came on to you, did he ever mention me?

138
00:11:36,822 --> 00:11:38,240
Not really.

139
00:11:38,939 --> 00:11:40,760
He only moaned my name.

140
00:11:43,568 --> 00:11:44,600
What about the pregnancy?

141
00:11:46,394 --> 00:11:50,520
He told me to keep a close eye on my body.

142
00:11:51,710 --> 00:11:54,880
If I accidentally got pregnant, I should get an abortion.

143
00:11:55,875 --> 00:11:58,720
He said I could still get one before five months.

144
00:11:59,667 --> 00:12:00,668
An abortion?

145
00:12:01,731 --> 00:12:03,160
What would happen if you refused?

146
00:12:07,400 --> 00:12:09,401
He'd probably kill me.

147
00:12:11,155 --> 00:12:13,600
He'd be afraid I'd use the baby to blackmail him.

148
00:12:14,803 --> 00:12:16,312
After all,

149
00:12:16,654 --> 00:12:20,720
he'll be dependent on Mrs. Nopnapha for the rest of his life.

150
00:12:24,600 --> 00:12:27,201
But isn't that just the life of a mistress?

151
00:12:28,376 --> 00:12:32,560
Men will always choose their wives in the end.

152
00:12:33,467 --> 00:12:37,344
We're just there to satisfy their desires.

153
00:12:43,680 --> 00:12:45,181
Are you pregnant, Ta?

154
00:12:46,379 --> 00:12:48,760
No. I was just curious.

155
00:13:01,552 --> 00:13:02,553
Uncle Phop.

156
00:13:11,280 --> 00:13:12,281
What happened?

157
00:13:13,483 --> 00:13:15,040
Someone broke into my office and searched it.

158
00:13:16,950 --> 00:13:19,320
It must've happened the other day when the fire alarm went off.

159
00:13:22,951 --> 00:13:23,952
Really?

160
00:13:26,168 --> 00:13:30,000
Is anything valuable or any important information missing?

161
00:13:31,320 --> 00:13:32,360
Not that I've found so far.

162
00:13:35,272 --> 00:13:38,440
I want to know who did it and what they were after,

163
00:13:39,939 --> 00:13:41,200
so I can deal with them.

164
00:13:50,880 --> 00:13:53,560
Tetris, Titus! Over here, sweethearts!

165
00:13:54,406 --> 00:13:55,407
Mom!

166
00:14:02,027 --> 00:14:04,760
Hi, Mom! Why did you come to pick us up today?

167
00:14:07,435 --> 00:14:09,440
Tetris, could you sit in the back, sweetheart?

168
00:14:09,510 --> 00:14:11,120
I want to talk to your sister today.

169
00:14:13,560 --> 00:14:14,561
Okay.

170
00:14:15,520 --> 00:14:16,521
Thank you, sweetheart.

171
00:14:52,416 --> 00:14:55,640
I know it doesn't look as pretty as before.

172
00:14:55,934 --> 00:14:57,902
But I really tried my best.

173
00:15:02,168 --> 00:15:04,920
I'm sorry. I lost my temper.

174
00:15:07,102 --> 00:15:08,104
But you know

175
00:15:09,016 --> 00:15:10,840
that woman drives me crazy.

176
00:15:12,696 --> 00:15:14,184
If you don't want to see me like that again,

177
00:15:15,739 --> 00:15:17,080
can you please stay away from her?

178
00:15:18,571 --> 00:15:19,572
No.

179
00:15:20,134 --> 00:15:22,280
I need to talk to Ta every day.

180
00:15:24,443 --> 00:15:26,400
Because you never have time to talk to me.

181
00:15:30,174 --> 00:15:32,286
So if I make more time for you,

182
00:15:33,448 --> 00:15:34,622
you'll stop talking to her, right?

183
00:15:36,763 --> 00:15:37,764
Maybe.

184
00:15:40,811 --> 00:15:42,038
Then what would you like to eat today, sweetheart?

185
00:15:43,030 --> 00:15:45,920
How about pizza followed by some ice cream?

186
00:15:48,928 --> 00:15:50,360
I don't like ice cream.

187
00:15:51,254 --> 00:15:52,600
I like bingsu.

188
00:15:56,056 --> 00:15:58,160
Okay, got it.

189
00:15:59,157 --> 00:16:00,158
Bingsu it is.

190
00:16:05,678 --> 00:16:06,679
What is it, Oshi?

191
00:16:07,272 --> 00:16:08,400
Big trouble, ma'am.

192
00:16:08,856 --> 00:16:10,400
Hong just sent word that...

193
00:16:10,467 --> 00:16:12,200
Wait, don't say anything yet.

194
00:16:16,707 --> 00:16:17,708
What did you say?

195
00:16:17,902 --> 00:16:19,960
That bitch Mutta is pregnant with the Director's baby again!

196
00:16:23,712 --> 00:16:26,300
Don't hang up. Give me a moment.

197
00:16:29,576 --> 00:16:30,680
Tetris and Titus.

198
00:16:31,214 --> 00:16:34,080
I have something urgent to take care of. I'm sorry, sweethearts.

199
00:16:56,936 --> 00:16:59,300
She's pregnant again? Who told you?

200
00:16:59,800 --> 00:17:00,801
Hong, ma'am.

201
00:17:09,472 --> 00:17:10,800
Hey, Chuenchom.

202
00:17:11,323 --> 00:17:13,160
When we get to the hospital,

203
00:17:13,568 --> 00:17:16,569
you'd better apologize to Toey on everyone's behalf.

204
00:17:16,806 --> 00:17:21,120
It was your idea to put Toey in that wheelchair.

205
00:17:21,140 --> 00:17:21,800
Got it?

206
00:17:21,888 --> 00:17:24,520
Hey, why is it my fault?

207
00:17:24,742 --> 00:17:27,000
Whoever's the strongest is the one to blame.

208
00:17:27,678 --> 00:17:29,800
I had nothing to do with it. I wasn't pushing.

209
00:17:29,960 --> 00:17:31,720
I barely even touched him.

210
00:17:33,200 --> 00:17:35,880
If we'd put Toey on the photocopier in the first place,

211
00:17:35,900 --> 00:17:38,254
we wouldn't have ended up in this mess, right?

212
00:17:44,288 --> 00:17:45,289
Ta.

213
00:17:45,611 --> 00:17:47,680
Hey, where did Ta go?

214
00:17:47,720 --> 00:17:49,621
Wasn't she just walking with us?

215
00:17:50,782 --> 00:17:53,500
- Maybe she stopped to take a dump.
- Oh, does she have diarrhea?

216
00:17:53,512 --> 00:17:55,400
Which funeral hall is Toey in again?

217
00:17:55,528 --> 00:17:57,500
We just saw him the other day. What a shame!

218
00:17:57,544 --> 00:17:58,680
I'll slap your mouth right off.

219
00:17:58,963 --> 00:18:00,400
He's just sick, not dead.

220
00:18:00,566 --> 00:18:02,240
Keep running your mouth and I'll have Toey fire you.

221
00:18:02,367 --> 00:18:04,880
Watch your own mouth, old lady, or I'll slap your dentures loose!

222
00:18:05,376 --> 00:18:07,080
- Let me go!
- Get her!

223
00:18:22,368 --> 00:18:23,369
Stop!

224
00:18:23,926 --> 00:18:24,927
Stop the van!

225
00:18:28,352 --> 00:18:29,353
Stop!

226
00:18:35,040 --> 00:18:38,000
Hey, security! What was that van that just came in?

227
00:18:38,176 --> 00:18:39,800
I'm not sure, ma'am.

228
00:18:40,224 --> 00:18:42,500
Then why did you let it in? Didn't they have to show ID?

229
00:18:43,515 --> 00:18:46,616
A senior official radioed in and told us to let that van through.

230
00:18:46,800 --> 00:18:48,880
He said it was strictly confidential.

231
00:18:49,801 --> 00:18:50,880
Which senior official?

232
00:18:51,720 --> 00:18:53,821
Well...

233
00:18:54,240 --> 00:18:55,241
Mr. Thaithat.

234
00:19:04,643 --> 00:19:06,160
I'm hungry. Give me the pear first.

235
00:19:06,440 --> 00:19:07,441
No!

236
00:19:07,475 --> 00:19:10,000
Oh, Ta! Come on, let's go visit Toey.

237
00:19:10,040 --> 00:19:11,041
I'm not going anymore!

238
00:19:12,131 --> 00:19:13,132
Everyone!

239
00:19:13,822 --> 00:19:15,823
How did Ta get ahead of us?

240
00:19:16,067 --> 00:19:17,840
Wasn't she walking behind us just a moment ago?

241
00:19:18,483 --> 00:19:19,680
What's she in such a hurry for?

242
00:19:19,784 --> 00:19:22,040
If I didn't know her, I'd think she was a purse snatcher.

243
00:19:25,379 --> 00:19:28,440
Why the hell is our ministry so huge? My feet are killing me!

244
00:19:40,360 --> 00:19:41,361
Ta!

245
00:19:42,000 --> 00:19:43,001
Ta!

246
00:19:44,072 --> 00:19:45,073
Ta!

247
00:19:45,448 --> 00:19:46,600
Oh, Ta!

248
00:19:47,379 --> 00:19:48,480
What happened?

249
00:19:48,771 --> 00:19:50,360
Someone grabbed me and dragged me into a van.

250
00:19:50,451 --> 00:19:52,120
They stuck a needle in my arm,

251
00:19:52,152 --> 00:19:53,600
then kicked me out onto the side of the road.

252
00:19:53,653 --> 00:19:54,454
What?

253
00:19:54,483 --> 00:19:56,483
Where did this happen?

254
00:19:56,606 --> 00:19:57,702
Right here at the Ministry.

255
00:19:58,110 --> 00:20:01,320
Nopnapha's the only one who'd stoop to something this vile.

256
00:20:04,446 --> 00:20:05,520
She's gone too far.

257
00:20:06,291 --> 00:20:09,000
Wait here, Ta. I'll deal with her myself.

258
00:20:15,000 --> 00:20:16,001
Ta.

259
00:20:17,101 --> 00:20:18,160
Let's get your wounds treated first. Come on.

260
00:20:28,214 --> 00:20:29,480
Did you see their faces?

261
00:20:30,390 --> 00:20:32,360
No. They were wearing ski masks.

262
00:20:32,640 --> 00:20:33,680
The van didn't have license plates either.

263
00:20:34,267 --> 00:20:37,531
And if we ask for the CCTV footage, the cameras will probably be broken again.

264
00:20:39,798 --> 00:20:41,520
What did you do to provoke Aunt Napha this time

265
00:20:41,728 --> 00:20:43,640
that made her send someone after you?

266
00:20:44,136 --> 00:20:46,240
Veekit, are you victim-blaming me?

267
00:20:47,100 --> 00:20:49,720
What could possibly justify Nopnapha doing this to me?

268
00:20:49,774 --> 00:20:52,739
No, I just want to know if you did anything to upset her,

269
00:20:53,181 --> 00:20:54,500
so I can figure out

270
00:20:55,843 --> 00:20:57,520
what she's trying to get revenge on you for.

271
00:21:00,814 --> 00:21:02,200
And what did they inject you with?

272
00:21:03,866 --> 00:21:07,240
Or was it just an empty syringe to freak you out?

273
00:21:10,392 --> 00:21:12,040
I haven't done anything to her

274
00:21:13,027 --> 00:21:14,400
since I went to their house.

275
00:21:14,995 --> 00:21:16,600
All I've done is talk to Tetris.

276
00:21:17,070 --> 00:21:18,071
What?

277
00:21:19,272 --> 00:21:20,273
Who did you say you were talking to?

278
00:21:20,696 --> 00:21:22,680
Titus. I got their names mixed up.

279
00:21:31,171 --> 00:21:32,440
When they stuck the needle in you,

280
00:21:33,384 --> 00:21:35,885
did you feel anything being injected?

281
00:21:36,520 --> 00:21:37,521
I don't know.

282
00:21:37,912 --> 00:21:39,760
I was too scared to notice anything.

283
00:21:40,136 --> 00:21:42,840
All I know is that they stuck a needle in me.

284
00:21:44,137 --> 00:21:45,180
Does your arm hurt now?

285
00:21:48,414 --> 00:21:49,415
No.

286
00:22:01,944 --> 00:22:02,945
Okay.

287
00:22:03,480 --> 00:22:04,810
Let's get you to a doctor afterward

288
00:22:05,840 --> 00:22:07,734
to check if anything's wrong.

289
00:22:08,041 --> 00:22:10,080
You might need antiviral medication as a precaution.

290
00:22:27,024 --> 00:22:28,880
Hey! Where's Napha?

291
00:22:30,128 --> 00:22:32,720
She's picking up Tetris and Titus from school.

292
00:22:33,446 --> 00:22:35,480
What did Napha do to Ta?

293
00:22:38,379 --> 00:22:40,683
- What?
- I asked you what Napha did to Ta!

294
00:22:41,270 --> 00:22:43,960
Ta was abducted in a van and stabbed with a syringe!

295
00:22:44,112 --> 00:22:45,113
What did she do to her?

296
00:22:46,113 --> 00:22:47,114
Well...

297
00:22:47,718 --> 00:22:49,719
We didn't do anything.

298
00:22:50,267 --> 00:22:52,384
Then why the hell are you so nervous?

299
00:22:52,440 --> 00:22:54,120
Huh? Why are you panicking?

300
00:22:54,246 --> 00:22:55,280
Tell me the truth!

301
00:22:55,656 --> 00:22:57,240
Please don't hurt me! I'm just a gay!

302
00:22:57,250 --> 00:22:59,880
Director, you'd better ask Nopnapha yourself.

303
00:22:59,910 --> 00:23:02,280
I already called her! She won't answer! Tell me!

304
00:23:02,691 --> 00:23:04,200
But we're just her assistants.

305
00:23:04,278 --> 00:23:05,560
We can't really say much.

306
00:23:05,640 --> 00:23:06,641
I know

307
00:23:06,915 --> 00:23:09,990
you two do all of Napha's dirty work!

308
00:23:10,152 --> 00:23:12,170
Tell me what you did! Huh?

309
00:23:12,478 --> 00:23:14,040
Director, please let go!

310
00:23:14,158 --> 00:23:16,190
This is serious misconduct. You could get fired!

311
00:23:16,220 --> 00:23:19,560
And what you did to Ta isn't serious? Huh?

312
00:23:19,600 --> 00:23:20,601
Huh?

313
00:23:20,952 --> 00:23:21,953
You're not going to tell me, are you?

314
00:23:22,153 --> 00:23:23,654
Let go of my staff right now!

315
00:23:28,120 --> 00:23:29,121
What did you do to Ta?

316
00:23:31,090 --> 00:23:32,120
She's pregnant.

317
00:23:33,520 --> 00:23:35,080
What? Pregnant?

318
00:23:36,866 --> 00:23:37,867
How did she get pregnant?

319
00:23:39,760 --> 00:23:43,120
Maybe she got pregnant by just standing on one leg and swallowing air!

320
00:23:47,830 --> 00:23:49,640
Because you slept with her, you idiot!

321
00:23:50,619 --> 00:23:51,840
How the hell is that possible?

322
00:23:52,768 --> 00:23:55,320
I've only slept with her once since she came back after her miscarriage.

323
00:23:56,787 --> 00:23:57,788
Well...

324
00:23:58,238 --> 00:24:00,080
I guess I've still got it.

325
00:24:01,491 --> 00:24:03,800
Is this really the time to be proud of yourself?

326
00:24:04,040 --> 00:24:06,141
Is this the time to brag?

327
00:24:07,288 --> 00:24:08,560
So what exactly did you do to Ta?

328
00:24:09,230 --> 00:24:10,520
What did you inject her with?

329
00:24:20,536 --> 00:24:23,100
What time are you taking your next dose? Have you decided?

330
00:24:24,419 --> 00:24:25,600
Let's say 6 a.m.

331
00:24:25,960 --> 00:24:27,520
I'll take it as soon as I wake up so I won't forget.

332
00:24:28,699 --> 00:24:31,500
Then I'll call you at 6:05 every day

333
00:24:31,854 --> 00:24:32,855
just in case you forget.

334
00:24:34,571 --> 00:24:36,040
I can set an alarm on my phone, you know.

335
00:24:36,486 --> 00:24:37,760
Why do you have to call me?

336
00:24:38,784 --> 00:24:39,785
Because I want to talk to you.

337
00:24:42,000 --> 00:24:43,001
Suit yourself.

338
00:24:47,678 --> 00:24:48,880
Are you still shaken up?

339
00:24:49,982 --> 00:24:51,200
I can stay and keep you company tonight.

340
00:24:54,355 --> 00:24:56,480
You always treat me like I'm so helpless.

341
00:24:57,523 --> 00:24:59,724
Thanks, but you should go home.

342
00:25:01,600 --> 00:25:02,601
Are you sure?

343
00:25:03,001 --> 00:25:04,280
Yeah, I'm sure.

344
00:25:07,960 --> 00:25:10,640
What if Aunt Napha injected you with a zombie virus?

345
00:25:10,867 --> 00:25:12,600
What if you turn into a zombie and go on a rampage tonight?

346
00:25:13,843 --> 00:25:15,120
Then you definitely shouldn't stay, right?

347
00:25:21,000 --> 00:25:23,500
Then call me if you feel like you're about to transform.

348
00:25:25,000 --> 00:25:26,001
Okay.

349
00:25:32,900 --> 00:25:33,901
I'm off.

350
00:25:39,400 --> 00:25:40,401
Last chance to change your mind.

351
00:25:41,401 --> 00:25:42,440
Just go.

352
00:25:44,011 --> 00:25:45,500
Okay, I won't bother you anymore.

353
00:25:47,500 --> 00:25:48,501
See you.

354
00:26:20,640 --> 00:26:22,680
Can you make a rabbit appear? I want one.

355
00:27:32,110 --> 00:27:34,035
Na, has Uncle Phop come home yet?

356
00:27:34,050 --> 00:27:35,051
Not yet.

357
00:27:37,011 --> 00:27:39,240
- What about Aunt Napha?
- She's not home either.

358
00:27:47,800 --> 00:27:48,801
Ta.

359
00:27:50,500 --> 00:27:51,680
It's me, Ta.

360
00:27:52,086 --> 00:27:53,287
Please open the door.

361
00:27:53,320 --> 00:27:56,321
Director.

362
00:27:59,000 --> 00:28:00,120
What is it?

363
00:28:00,740 --> 00:28:01,780
Are you pregnant, Ta?

364
00:28:02,454 --> 00:28:04,480
Then why didn't you tell me?

365
00:28:05,792 --> 00:28:08,500
Come on, Ta. Open the door, please.

366
00:28:09,446 --> 00:28:12,560
If I accidentally got pregnant, I should get an abortion.

367
00:28:13,200 --> 00:28:14,640
What would happen if you refused?

368
00:28:14,801 --> 00:28:16,760
He'd probably kill me.

369
00:28:17,254 --> 00:28:19,800
He'd be afraid I'd use the baby to blackmail him.

370
00:28:21,059 --> 00:28:22,400
After all,

371
00:28:22,780 --> 00:28:26,840
he'll be dependent on Mrs. Nopnapha for the rest of his life.

372
00:28:28,051 --> 00:28:29,052
Ta.

373
00:28:29,176 --> 00:28:30,177
Ta!

374
00:28:30,744 --> 00:28:31,800
Open the door.

375
00:28:32,400 --> 00:28:33,640
Just a moment, Director.

376
00:28:52,566 --> 00:28:53,567
Ta.

377
00:29:13,600 --> 00:29:14,680
Are you really pregnant?

378
00:29:16,900 --> 00:29:17,901
Yes.

379
00:29:18,232 --> 00:29:19,233
I'm pregnant.

380
00:29:20,500 --> 00:29:22,501
It happened that afternoon we went to the hotel.

381
00:29:22,900 --> 00:29:23,901
I got pregnant after just one time.

382
00:29:24,819 --> 00:29:25,820
What the hell?

383
00:29:26,136 --> 00:29:28,320
Didn't you say you had a contraceptive implant?

384
00:29:28,600 --> 00:29:29,961
How could you get pregnant?

385
00:29:30,600 --> 00:29:32,100
It's not 100% effective.

386
00:29:33,500 --> 00:29:35,200
But I'm not having an abortion.

387
00:29:36,110 --> 00:29:37,311
I'm keeping the baby.

388
00:29:53,678 --> 00:29:54,880
That's the right decision.

389
00:29:56,947 --> 00:29:58,240
It's our baby, after all.

390
00:29:58,995 --> 00:30:00,180
How could we abort our own child?

391
00:30:07,550 --> 00:30:10,840
I know I may have said I didn't want children,

392
00:30:11,600 --> 00:30:13,320
but now that we've brought a child into this world,

393
00:30:13,630 --> 00:30:14,740
we have to raise it.

394
00:30:16,100 --> 00:30:17,101
Here's what we'll do.

395
00:30:19,123 --> 00:30:20,862
I'll take you for your prenatal checkups.

396
00:30:21,464 --> 00:30:24,320
As for our future, we'll figure that out later.

397
00:30:28,336 --> 00:30:30,827
But how did you know I was pregnant, Director?

398
00:30:32,214 --> 00:30:33,320
I'm not the only one who knows.

399
00:30:33,894 --> 00:30:35,360
Napha knows too.

400
00:30:35,808 --> 00:30:37,040
Her informant told her.

401
00:30:38,000 --> 00:30:39,001
Well...

402
00:30:39,776 --> 00:30:41,520
The reason she had people abduct you

403
00:30:41,900 --> 00:30:44,040
was just to draw your blood and confirm whether you're really pregnant.

404
00:30:44,854 --> 00:30:46,100
It wasn't anything dangerous.

405
00:30:48,216 --> 00:30:49,280
A blood test?

406
00:30:51,200 --> 00:30:52,201
Yes.

407
00:30:54,560 --> 00:30:55,920
The results should be back tonight.

408
00:31:06,664 --> 00:31:07,665
And these

409
00:31:10,424 --> 00:31:12,400
are vitamins and prenatal supplements.

410
00:31:13,520 --> 00:31:15,360
Just take them like you did during your last pregnancy.

411
00:31:31,726 --> 00:31:32,727
What?

412
00:31:32,883 --> 00:31:34,600
So all our suspicions about Jenphop

413
00:31:34,744 --> 00:31:36,120
were just in our heads?

414
00:31:36,552 --> 00:31:39,411
Yeah. He's a better person than we thought.

415
00:31:40,075 --> 00:31:41,400
He really loves his child.

416
00:31:41,584 --> 00:31:44,312
He even gave me some prenatal supplements.

417
00:31:45,438 --> 00:31:47,032
And his burner phone?

418
00:31:47,896 --> 00:31:48,958
He uses it to bet on football.

419
00:31:49,304 --> 00:31:51,174
He said he was afraid of ruining his reputation if he got caught.

420
00:31:51,180 --> 00:31:52,520
So that's why he uses a burner phone.

421
00:31:53,523 --> 00:31:55,000
What a complete waste of time!

422
00:31:57,363 --> 00:31:58,520
I don't think it was a waste.

423
00:31:59,992 --> 00:32:01,240
Now we know for sure

424
00:32:02,083 --> 00:32:03,200
that Nopnapha

425
00:32:04,000 --> 00:32:05,160
was the one who killed my sister.

426
00:32:06,291 --> 00:32:07,560
We've been going after the right person.

427
00:32:08,862 --> 00:32:10,120
And it also made me realize

428
00:32:10,723 --> 00:32:12,160
she didn't just kill my sister.

429
00:32:13,400 --> 00:32:14,760
She killed my niece or nephew, too.

430
00:32:15,931 --> 00:32:17,120
From now on,

431
00:32:18,000 --> 00:32:19,401
I'm going all out against her.

432
00:32:26,411 --> 00:32:28,040
And what the hell are these prenatal supplements?

433
00:32:28,571 --> 00:32:29,840
Why don't they have any labels?

434
00:32:44,171 --> 00:32:45,500
Here we go.

435
00:32:45,870 --> 00:32:48,040
Daddy's special steamed eggs.

436
00:32:48,392 --> 00:32:50,760
Ready to serve.

437
00:32:50,810 --> 00:32:54,480
This one's yours, with extra sausage.

438
00:32:54,511 --> 00:32:57,100
And this one's Titus's, loaded with crab sticks.

439
00:32:57,590 --> 00:32:59,400
Dig in!

440
00:33:04,112 --> 00:33:05,920
You kids are so lucky.

441
00:33:06,742 --> 00:33:09,400
Your dad makes you steamed eggs every morning.

442
00:33:16,774 --> 00:33:18,440
But from now on...

443
00:33:19,200 --> 00:33:21,801
But what if, one day, Dad has to split his time with another family

444
00:33:22,294 --> 00:33:25,040
and make steamed eggs for someone else's kids?

445
00:33:25,963 --> 00:33:27,880
How would you two feel?

446
00:33:27,900 --> 00:33:28,901
Hey!

447
00:33:30,016 --> 00:33:31,880
Can you stop ruining this lovely morning

448
00:33:32,070 --> 00:33:33,700
by turning the kids against me?

449
00:33:35,808 --> 00:33:37,240
Kids, don't listen to your mother.

450
00:33:37,347 --> 00:33:39,971
I promise I'll never leave you.

451
00:33:40,500 --> 00:33:43,001
I love you two more than anything in the world. Believe me.

452
00:33:45,000 --> 00:33:48,601
If you want them to believe you, stop having affairs.

453
00:33:49,075 --> 00:33:50,755
Stop getting women pregnant left and right

454
00:33:50,840 --> 00:33:52,974
and leaving us to clean up your messes.

455
00:33:53,064 --> 00:33:55,640
- One slip-up could ruin everything.
- Can we not discuss this in front of the kids?

456
00:33:56,705 --> 00:33:58,960
Shouldn't they know what kind of man their father is?

457
00:33:59,360 --> 00:34:01,640
If you're ashamed of yourself, then stop doing it.

458
00:34:06,726 --> 00:34:08,927
Mutta's pregnancy test results are back.

459
00:34:10,864 --> 00:34:12,465
Go on. Say it loud and clear.

460
00:34:12,800 --> 00:34:14,101
She's not pregnant!

461
00:34:15,376 --> 00:34:16,377
What?

462
00:34:16,912 --> 00:34:17,913
She's not pregnant?

463
00:34:21,811 --> 00:34:22,812
What the hell?

464
00:34:23,363 --> 00:34:25,000
I was just talking to her about our baby yesterday!

465
00:34:26,616 --> 00:34:30,080
She was playing mind games with you, and you fell for it!

466
00:34:30,440 --> 00:34:31,726
You're such an idiot.

467
00:34:31,838 --> 00:34:33,450
You fall for every trick she pulls.

468
00:34:33,480 --> 00:34:34,856
Will you stop calling me an idiot?

469
00:34:35,651 --> 00:34:36,717
I'm your husband!

470
00:34:37,200 --> 00:34:38,410
Show me some respect!

471
00:34:39,389 --> 00:34:41,110
What's there to respect about a husband like you?

472
00:34:42,462 --> 00:34:45,120
If I can't call you an idiot, should I call you a moron instead?

473
00:34:45,464 --> 00:34:46,920
- Would that sound better?
- Napha!

474
00:35:00,286 --> 00:35:02,600
Hurry up and eat, kids, or you'll be late for school.

475
00:35:08,700 --> 00:35:11,401
Ta, so you're not pregnant after all?

476
00:35:11,784 --> 00:35:13,533
Come see me in my office when you get to the Ministry.

477
00:35:14,894 --> 00:35:17,400
And throw away those pills I gave you.

478
00:35:17,495 --> 00:35:18,496
Okay.

479
00:35:19,000 --> 00:35:20,001
Bye, then.

480
00:35:27,808 --> 00:35:29,920
So, are you pregnant or not, Ta?

481
00:35:31,704 --> 00:35:33,280
How did you hear about that, Titus?

482
00:35:34,574 --> 00:35:36,160
I heard Mom and Dad fighting.

483
00:35:37,500 --> 00:35:38,920
I'm not pregnant, sweetie.

484
00:35:39,368 --> 00:35:40,640
It was just a misunderstanding.

485
00:35:42,032 --> 00:35:44,731
Aww! Now I won't get a little sibling!

486
00:35:49,814 --> 00:35:52,520
That mistress spread fake news to Mom that she's pregnant.

487
00:35:52,614 --> 00:35:53,615
She's so evil!

488
00:35:54,500 --> 00:35:57,100
I don't think so. Why would she do that?

489
00:35:57,990 --> 00:35:59,531
To make Mom and Dad fight, obviously!

490
00:35:59,627 --> 00:36:01,600
They were just going at each other like crazy.

491
00:36:02,109 --> 00:36:03,210
Are you okay?

492
00:36:03,875 --> 00:36:06,176
How could I be okay when my parents are fighting?

493
00:36:14,300 --> 00:36:15,301
Give me your money!

494
00:36:15,600 --> 00:36:16,601
Hey!

495
00:36:16,806 --> 00:36:19,760
You were out selling yourself just last night!

496
00:36:19,900 --> 00:36:21,000
I saw you!

497
00:36:21,392 --> 00:36:23,520
Give me the money! I need to buy booze!

498
00:36:23,560 --> 00:36:24,661
Hurry the hell up!

499
00:36:24,880 --> 00:36:26,881
- You wanna drink so badly?
- Yeah!

500
00:36:29,283 --> 00:36:31,600
Then drink this! Here, drink up!

501
00:36:31,654 --> 00:36:33,920
Go on! You wanna drink? Drink!

502
00:36:34,020 --> 00:36:35,080
You damn freeloader!

503
00:36:35,321 --> 00:36:36,322
Blood!

504
00:36:39,184 --> 00:36:41,300
You actually made me bleed?

505
00:36:41,320 --> 00:36:42,521
Why the hell wouldn't I?

506
00:36:50,336 --> 00:36:51,337
Don't you dare!

507
00:36:54,334 --> 00:36:56,360
Are you my wife or a rabid dog?

508
00:36:57,128 --> 00:36:58,560
Fine! I'll find myself another wife!

509
00:36:59,100 --> 00:37:00,600
Go to hell for all I care!

510
00:37:04,200 --> 00:37:07,160
Come back and take one of your kids with you!

511
00:37:07,301 --> 00:37:08,320
You bastard!

512
00:37:09,440 --> 00:37:11,480
I don't want to raise them! Come take one!

513
00:37:14,843 --> 00:37:17,280
Ever since that mistress came back, they've been fighting more often.

514
00:37:17,494 --> 00:37:18,495
It's getting worse.

515
00:37:20,576 --> 00:37:21,577
I'm sorry.

516
00:37:22,300 --> 00:37:23,401
What are you sorry for?

517
00:37:25,109 --> 00:37:26,110
Nothing.

518
00:37:26,640 --> 00:37:27,880
Don't dwell on it, okay?

519
00:37:28,395 --> 00:37:30,096
Let the adults sort it out.

520
00:37:30,880 --> 00:37:31,960
I'll try.

521
00:37:32,601 --> 00:37:34,300
You can always talk to me about anything.

522
00:37:35,000 --> 00:37:36,001
Thanks.

523
00:37:58,100 --> 00:37:59,566
Hi, Ta.

524
00:37:59,966 --> 00:38:01,880
Where did you go yesterday?

525
00:38:01,970 --> 00:38:03,740
Why didn't you come visit Toey with us?

526
00:38:05,056 --> 00:38:06,341
You should know.

527
00:38:06,680 --> 00:38:07,840
Don't pretend you don't.

528
00:38:08,592 --> 00:38:11,131
Aren't you the one spying on me for Nopnapha?

529
00:38:13,611 --> 00:38:17,147
What spy, Ta? I don't understand.

530
00:38:18,715 --> 00:38:20,198
Besides being such a phony,

531
00:38:20,736 --> 00:38:22,100
you need to stop lying, too.

532
00:38:22,720 --> 00:38:24,600
You're the only person I told about my pregnancy.

533
00:38:25,021 --> 00:38:26,122
If it wasn't you,

534
00:38:26,355 --> 00:38:29,070
who the hell else could've told Nopnapha?

535
00:38:35,000 --> 00:38:36,001
Ta.

536
00:38:37,990 --> 00:38:39,910
I'm on your side.

537
00:38:41,083 --> 00:38:43,084
Cut the crap.

538
00:38:49,259 --> 00:38:51,968
Well, civil servants don't make much money.

539
00:38:53,595 --> 00:38:55,880
It's barely enough to cover my train fare.

540
00:38:57,251 --> 00:39:01,171
So I have to take on side jobs for her sometimes.

541
00:39:01,534 --> 00:39:04,480
Including having sex in exchange for fruits and vegetables, right?

542
00:39:08,400 --> 00:39:11,401
Ta! Don't talk about that here!

543
00:39:11,942 --> 00:39:15,195
So it's fine for you to report my business, but yours is off-limits?

544
00:39:20,152 --> 00:39:22,320
Please, Ta, I'm begging you.

545
00:39:23,688 --> 00:39:26,680
Don't tell anyone about this.

546
00:39:27,918 --> 00:39:31,640
I'll stop spying for her if you want.

547
00:39:34,702 --> 00:39:35,703
No need.

548
00:39:36,500 --> 00:39:38,011
Keep spying for her.

549
00:39:38,645 --> 00:39:40,149
But whatever you report to her

550
00:39:40,939 --> 00:39:42,560
has to come from me and me alone.

551
00:39:44,741 --> 00:39:48,720
Then I'd be betraying her.

552
00:39:49,043 --> 00:39:50,800
I'd be playing both sides.

553
00:39:51,784 --> 00:39:53,267
Oh, so you've got such high morals now?

554
00:39:54,155 --> 00:39:55,156
Are you saying you can't do it?

555
00:39:55,544 --> 00:39:56,645
I can.

556
00:39:57,432 --> 00:39:59,880
And from now on, you'll help me

557
00:40:00,296 --> 00:40:01,800
whenever I need you.

558
00:40:04,206 --> 00:40:05,640
Yes, Ta.

559
00:40:07,443 --> 00:40:08,445
By the way,

560
00:40:09,928 --> 00:40:12,520
how much will you pay me per job?

561
00:40:13,709 --> 00:40:17,320
Nopnapha pays me 5,000 baht a job, you know?

562
00:40:17,600 --> 00:40:19,960
What a liar! More like 500!

563
00:40:23,056 --> 00:40:26,600
550, then. That's 50 more than she pays me.

564
00:40:27,500 --> 00:40:30,900
Actually, I don't have to pay you anything extra.

565
00:40:31,147 --> 00:40:32,848
Keeping my mouth shut

566
00:40:33,131 --> 00:40:34,971
about your content featuring men you've slept with is payment enough.

567
00:40:35,990 --> 00:40:36,991
Am I right?

568
00:40:40,256 --> 00:40:41,257
Yes.

569
00:40:41,739 --> 00:40:43,300
500 is fine, then.

570
00:40:54,045 --> 00:40:55,920
- Come here. I'll help push.
- Leave me alone.

571
00:40:55,952 --> 00:40:57,440
- I'm just trying to help.
- Don't!

572
00:41:00,000 --> 00:41:02,440
- Hello, Toey!
- Hello, Toey!

573
00:41:03,220 --> 00:41:05,880
I brought you some fermented chicken tendons today.

574
00:41:05,990 --> 00:41:07,900
A little extra calcium

575
00:41:07,963 --> 00:41:10,560
to help strengthen your bones!

576
00:41:10,622 --> 00:41:15,080
And I brought you Thai apples, imitated the ones from China.

577
00:41:15,224 --> 00:41:19,080
Five for 100 baht at Khlong Toei Market.

578
00:41:20,296 --> 00:41:22,160
I think you two should take that stuff back.

579
00:41:22,300 --> 00:41:23,520
Toey can't eat any of it.

580
00:41:24,500 --> 00:41:25,601
How would you know, old lady?

581
00:41:25,840 --> 00:41:28,960
Oh, come on! I'm just trying to please my boss!

582
00:41:29,059 --> 00:41:31,320
Stop butting in! Are you his wife or something?

583
00:41:32,627 --> 00:41:35,120
Toey, would you like some? I'll fry them for you.

584
00:41:35,140 --> 00:41:36,400
I bought them raw.

585
00:41:36,800 --> 00:41:39,640
Toey, why aren't you saying anything?

586
00:41:40,011 --> 00:41:41,600
Why are you just sitting there with your mouth shut?

587
00:41:42,715 --> 00:41:44,960
You two really have no idea, do you?

588
00:41:45,344 --> 00:41:46,720
Then open your eyes and look!

589
00:41:50,862 --> 00:41:53,640
Whoa! He's toothless!

590
00:41:55,064 --> 00:41:56,720
Sorry, Toey!

591
00:41:56,910 --> 00:41:59,360
How about I chew the food for you

592
00:41:59,443 --> 00:42:01,960
and feed it to you one bite at a time?

593
00:42:02,584 --> 00:42:04,120
Toey!

594
00:42:04,221 --> 00:42:08,800
I brought you sun-dried beef and sticky rice, Toey.

595
00:42:08,827 --> 00:42:10,720
And I brought you two things.

596
00:42:10,828 --> 00:42:13,248
Sweet rice brittle and crispy noodles.

597
00:42:13,307 --> 00:42:15,808
Something to snack on when you're free.

598
00:42:16,308 --> 00:42:17,489
Hey, listen!

599
00:42:18,067 --> 00:42:21,120
Stop fussing over me and get back to work!

600
00:42:21,624 --> 00:42:23,520
If you all worked as hard

601
00:42:23,710 --> 00:42:26,100
as you do sucking up to me,

602
00:42:26,158 --> 00:42:30,760
Thailand would've become a developed country long ago.

603
00:42:31,000 --> 00:42:32,001
Go!

604
00:42:33,400 --> 00:42:34,401
Wait!

605
00:42:35,201 --> 00:42:37,160
And about what I said earlier,

606
00:42:38,096 --> 00:42:39,400
that I'd resign and let you all keep your jobs...

607
00:42:40,000 --> 00:42:41,520
I take it back!

608
00:42:42,700 --> 00:42:43,701
I'm gonna faint.

609
00:42:44,192 --> 00:42:45,193
Go!

610
00:42:46,656 --> 00:42:48,257
- Then who's getting fired?
- Exactly!

611
00:42:48,403 --> 00:42:51,360
- Come on, Sak. I'll wheel Toey back to his office.
- Stop!

612
00:42:51,419 --> 00:42:53,320
Leave me alone! Get back to work! Go away!

613
00:42:53,330 --> 00:42:54,201
Huh?

614
00:42:54,264 --> 00:42:56,480
Come on, Toey. I will wheel you back.

615
00:42:56,600 --> 00:42:58,395
Easy, Sak! Don't go so fast!

616
00:42:58,410 --> 00:42:59,542
- Slowly!
- Okay!

617
00:43:03,500 --> 00:43:05,201
Wait a second!

618
00:43:05,520 --> 00:43:06,521
Hey, Auntie!

619
00:43:07,000 --> 00:43:11,640
Don't you think Uncle Sak is trying to outshine you?

620
00:43:12,174 --> 00:43:15,520
He doesn't respect his elders at all.

621
00:43:17,646 --> 00:43:20,600
I don't mean to stir up trouble,

622
00:43:20,979 --> 00:43:22,080
but I think

623
00:43:22,300 --> 00:43:25,680
he's definitely after your position as department head.

624
00:43:26,771 --> 00:43:28,440
And if he gets it,

625
00:43:28,998 --> 00:43:30,680
you'll be cast aside

626
00:43:30,918 --> 00:43:33,760
like a stray dog on the street.

627
00:43:34,758 --> 00:43:39,182
Then you'll be a gray-haired old hag

628
00:43:39,220 --> 00:43:42,960
and an unwanted stray dog.

629
00:43:46,936 --> 00:43:49,937
Auntie, you never know.

630
00:43:50,080 --> 00:43:54,440
You might even be the one who gets fired

631
00:43:54,584 --> 00:43:56,800
along with that Mutta.

632
00:43:56,843 --> 00:44:00,000
Ew! What's that smell, Cha-am?

633
00:44:00,022 --> 00:44:01,045
What?

634
00:44:01,152 --> 00:44:02,600
Something really stinks.

635
00:44:03,680 --> 00:44:06,081
Smells like an unwanted stray dog!

636
00:44:13,681 --> 00:44:15,700
- You and I are staying.
- Why'd you hit me so hard?

637
00:44:23,560 --> 00:44:24,561
Veekit.

638
00:44:32,350 --> 00:44:34,680
Didn't you say you'd call to remind me to take my antivirals?

639
00:44:34,750 --> 00:44:35,880
You never called.

640
00:44:36,851 --> 00:44:38,000
Well, you don't need to take them anymore.

641
00:44:40,622 --> 00:44:42,720
Aunt Napha just drew your blood for a pregnancy test.

642
00:44:43,635 --> 00:44:45,250
She didn't inject you with any germs.

643
00:44:46,760 --> 00:44:47,880
So you know everything already?

644
00:44:50,000 --> 00:44:52,100
Tetris and Titus overheard their parents fighting.

645
00:44:52,558 --> 00:44:53,640
So they told me about it.

646
00:44:59,123 --> 00:45:00,280
How are the kids doing?

647
00:45:01,480 --> 00:45:02,520
Do they seem stressed?

648
00:45:02,659 --> 00:45:03,660
Why do you ask?

649
00:45:05,992 --> 00:45:08,904
Wasn't it your plan to tear their family apart?

650
00:45:12,344 --> 00:45:13,345
Ta.

651
00:45:17,200 --> 00:45:18,501
Come talk to me in my office.

652
00:45:38,680 --> 00:45:40,381
Why did you lie to me about being pregnant?

653
00:45:43,627 --> 00:45:45,467
I just wanted to test you, Director.

654
00:45:46,000 --> 00:45:47,001
Test me?

655
00:45:47,801 --> 00:45:49,400
By lying about being pregnant?

656
00:45:50,112 --> 00:45:51,520
Why would you need to test me?

657
00:45:53,900 --> 00:45:57,301
I just wanted to know if I really got pregnant with your child,

658
00:45:57,800 --> 00:45:59,920
would you be ready to start a family with me?

659
00:46:01,024 --> 00:46:03,960
Being a mistress is never a secure position.

660
00:46:04,307 --> 00:46:05,760
A man can leave you whenever he wants.

661
00:46:11,774 --> 00:46:13,175
But now I know

662
00:46:14,280 --> 00:46:17,600
that you're truly serious about me and your feelings are genuine.

663
00:46:18,585 --> 00:46:19,586
Oh,

664
00:46:25,971 --> 00:46:26,972
you silly girl.

665
00:46:37,838 --> 00:46:38,839
Ta.

666
00:46:41,054 --> 00:46:43,040
Let me assure you

667
00:46:44,206 --> 00:46:45,480
that one day,

668
00:46:46,515 --> 00:46:50,416
I'll divorce Napha and come live with you. I promise.

669
00:46:54,963 --> 00:46:57,250
You don't need to test me

670
00:46:58,664 --> 00:47:01,000
or make me prove myself to you ever again, Ta.

671
00:47:02,190 --> 00:47:03,191
Understand?

672
00:47:05,483 --> 00:47:07,640
Yes, Director.

673
00:47:08,246 --> 00:47:09,447
Now I know

674
00:47:10,300 --> 00:47:12,601
that you're a man of your word.

675
00:47:14,100 --> 00:47:15,200
I'll wait for you.

676
00:47:16,520 --> 00:47:19,440
I'll wait for the day we can finally be a real family.

677
00:47:21,971 --> 00:47:22,972
Okay.

678
00:47:24,611 --> 00:47:26,412
I'll be waiting for that day, too.

679
00:47:29,464 --> 00:47:30,465
Ta.

680
00:47:31,357 --> 00:47:33,400
Then let's have a little drink to celebrate.

681
00:47:52,416 --> 00:47:54,560
I had the pills Jenphop gave you checked.

682
00:47:54,896 --> 00:47:57,520
One was a painkiller, and the other was a sleeping pill.

683
00:47:58,320 --> 00:47:59,321
As for the suppository,

684
00:48:00,357 --> 00:48:01,458
it was an abortion drug.

685
00:48:07,014 --> 00:48:08,415
Ta?

686
00:48:13,760 --> 00:48:16,450
Why are you looking at me like that? Is something wrong?

687
00:48:36,731 --> 00:48:37,960
Whose house have you brought me to?

688
00:48:38,211 --> 00:48:39,212
It's a surprise.

689
00:48:40,883 --> 00:48:43,080
That dining table looks a little odd to me.

690
00:48:44,200 --> 00:48:45,680
When did you two build a house together?

691
00:48:45,741 --> 00:48:47,520
- You're going to live with her, aren't you?
- Yes, I am!

692
00:48:51,247 --> 00:48:54,048
After pulling everything off so successfully,

693
00:48:54,166 --> 00:48:56,040
don't I deserve a little reward?

694
00:49:00,939 --> 00:49:02,360
Jicama.

695
00:49:07,590 --> 00:49:08,880
You're not Mutta, are you?

696
00:49:10,454 --> 00:49:13,240
Do you know how many steps there are here?

697
00:49:14,520 --> 00:49:15,660
306 steps.

698
00:49:15,700 --> 00:49:18,520
Now pick which step you want to die on.
